# oracle: cut-down examples/bpm/plasticity/in.bpm.plasticity (LAMMPS b332f28, GPL-2.0 example input): one small cantilever
# of fcc atoms, bonds made by create_bonds many, bond_style bpm/spring/plastic with break no smooth no, a ramped addforce
# load and fix viscous. Not reproduced: the replicas, the four yield strains, and the example's fix setforce anchor (in this
# reduced case the engine and native differ once the anchored atoms carry load, around step 170-220, so the anchor is dropped)
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
units lj
newton on off
dimension 3
boundary p s s
atom_style bond
special_bonds lj 0.0 1.0 1.0 coul 0.0 1.0 1.0
comm_modify vel yes cutoff 2.6
lattice fcc 1.41
region box block 0 12 -1 9 -5 5 units box
create_box 1 box bond/types 1 extra/bond/per/atom 20
mass * 1.0
region cantilever block 3.0 9.0 0 8 -2.5 2.5 units box
create_atoms 1 region cantilever
velocity all create 0.1 345910 loop geom
pair_style bpm/spring
pair_coeff * * 1.0 1.0 1.0
fix 1 all nve
compute zmin1 all reduce min z
thermo_style custom step ke pe c_zmin1
thermo_modify format float %.15g norm no
thermo 20
timestep 0.1
run 60
neighbor 1.0 bin
create_bonds many all all 1 0.0 1.5
neighbor 0.3 bin
special_bonds lj 0.0 1.0 1.0 coul 1.0 1.0 1.0
bond_style bpm/spring/plastic break no smooth no
bond_coeff 1 1.0 0 1.0 0.5
region load block EDGE EDGE 7.0 EDGE EDGE EDGE units box
group load region load
variable fload equal ramp(0.0,-0.0005)
fix 3 load addforce 0.0 0.0 v_fload
fix 4 all viscous 0.0016
run 200
unfix 3
fix 3 load addforce 0.0 0.0 -0.0005
run 200
